e":"本篇朱建子使匈奴、罵單于而死，單于未具名且出使、死亡未明年。7wk_awi_f4x為來源局部候選，不是已證另有第四位單于。冒頓、老上稽粥、軍臣是依文帝敘事背景先列的可比對者，不是窮盡名單；尚未排除子傳敘事省略較後年代。不可套父死年或任官年指定單于，亦不將死匈奴中改作單于殺之。","references":[{"title":"《史記·匈奴列傳》單于承接","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷110&oldid=8735645","quote":"後頃之，冒頓死，子稽粥立，號曰老上單于。","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·匈奴列傳》單于承接","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷110&oldid=8735645","quote":"老上稽粥單于初立，孝文皇帝復遣宗室女公主爲單于閼氏，使宦者燕人中行說傅公主。說不欲行，漢彊使之。說曰：「必我行也，爲漢患者。」中行說既至，因降單于，單于甚親幸之。","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·匈奴列傳》單于承接","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷110&oldid=8735645","quote":"後四歳，老上稽粥單于死，子軍臣立爲單于。既立，孝文皇帝復與匈奴和親。而中行說復事之。","image_verified":false}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli","source_id":"s-shiji-097-luli"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"7wk_awi_f4x","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"7wk_awi_f4x","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji097-038","person_id":"7wk_awi_f4x","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-097-luli"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["單于"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p020","quote":"孝文帝時，淮南厲王殺辟陽侯，以諸呂故。文帝聞其客平原君為計策，使吏捕欲治。聞吏至門，平原君欲自殺。諸子及吏皆曰：「事未可知，何早自殺為？」平原君曰：「我死禍絕，不及而身矣。」遂自剄。孝文帝聞而惜之，曰：「吾無意殺之。」乃召其子，拜為中大夫。使匈奴，單于無禮，乃罵單于，遂死匈奴中。"}],"rationale":"按酈生、陸賈與朱建分傳及敘事承接限定異稱；尉他尉佗原字分存。平原君據明示朱建另候選；朱建兩處未名子依古注另存暫定同指，淮陰侯與韓信同指另列證據。引語古王及神話人物與當事人分開。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p020","text":"孝文帝時，淮南厲王殺辟陽侯，以諸呂故。文帝聞其客平原君為計策，使吏捕欲治。聞吏至門，平原君欲自殺。諸子及吏皆曰：「事未可知，何早自殺為？」平原君曰：「我死禍絕，不及而身矣。」遂自剄。孝文帝聞而惜之，曰：「吾無意殺之。」乃召其子，拜為中大夫。使匈奴，單于無禮，乃罵單于，遂死匈奴中。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0005","start":5,"end":9,"surface":"淮南厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"qg7_n12_fne","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"tkc_9z3_91l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"tkc_9z3_91l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"諸子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"來源未名群體，不補具名成員或確切子序數。"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0069","start":69,"end":72,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"tkc_9z3_91l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"其子","kind":"person","person_id":"tkc_9z3_91l_A","status":"contex